  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive energy access for accelerating economic growth in Karnali corridor (TA SASEC/ETDSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The TA will pilot the Build4Skills approach at selected project sites to facilitate job placement for local people. It will build on the prior experiences of UNDP, ADB, and Norwegian-funded projects to enhance the livelihoods of women and disadvantaged groups in Jumla, Dailekh, and Kalikot districts. It will also support institutionalizing gender equality and social inclusion (GESI) and implementing the gender action plan linked to the loan.</narrative>
  </description>
